   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">type alias</span> UdsMessagePtr <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Diagnostics.pdf#nameddest=SWS_DM_00303\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Diagnostics.pdf)\">[SWS_DM_00303]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/FO/AUTOSAR_FO_RS_Diagnostics.pdf#nameddest=RS_Diag_04147\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_FO_RS_Diagnostics.pdf)\">RS_Diag_04147</a></span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">using UdsMessagePtr = <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::unique_ptr</a>&lt;<a class=\"vis-internal\" href=\"../classes/cl_apext_diag_uds_transport_UdsMessage_a98d15.html\">UdsMessage</a>, <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::function</a>&lt;void(<a class=\"vis-internal\" href=\"../classes/cl_apext_diag_uds_transport_UdsMessage_a98d15.html\">UdsMessage</a>*)&gt;&gt;;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This is the unique_ptr for UdsMessages containing a custom deleter as provided by the generic/ core DM part towards the UdsTransportLayer-Plugin.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n\n"
  },
