   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"notes\"><b>Hinweise:</b> How the exact typedef for UdsMessagePtr looks like, is up to the DM product vendor. I.e. how f.i. the deleter signature looks like ... basically the minimal agreement is: UdsMessagePtr shall behave like a std::unique_ptr&lt;UdsMessage&gt;!</div>",
